        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/edb3f5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-03T22:37:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Jeysie, I said SPECIFICALLY: \" Yes, I was hoping both the company and fans of the paper game would be concerned as I am and exert pressure, but from this small sample size it seems clear people are content with the status quo, so I will cease using this forum for this line of discourse \" My only contributions after that admission is to specifically refute what I consider to be gloss (namely, we knew it took a back seat to DIGITAL OBLIVAEON specifically).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
