      {
        "id": 224889,
        "name": "MigrantP",
        "username": "MigrantP",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-04T02:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I used the word obligation above because we have a clear obligation to develop and release OblivAeon for the digital game: several thousand people have already paid for it and are waiting.</p>\n<p>We have no such obligation to develop new features for Sentinels Sidekick. We have done so and will do so, but our obligations must take priority.</p>\n<p>And now, it's time for obligatory semantic satiation.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:22.814Z",
