      {
        "id": 224890,
        "name": "Ulf316",
        "username": "Ulf316",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/edb3f5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-04T03:08:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It absolutely changes the narrative from \"It can come out anytime\" to \"It'll ONLY come out after digital Oblivaeon\". \"Future Update\" could be tomorrow. \"Future Update after Digital Oblivaeon\" is much more transparent. If at any time before I asked Tuesday this had been clearly stated to the numerous queries made, I, nor the people I know who are also waiting and could care less about digital wouldn't have been checking our \"Ap Store Updates\" every week since September to see if it's patched in.</p>\n<p>I shared this clarity with the community. The white knights came out in force and got to righteously crush an evil foe. Case Closed I'd say.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:22.876Z",
